<template><div><h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1><section><h2 id="details-preparation">Before you enter</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-goal" data-guide-step>For your first portal unlock, complete the named story mission for its gold relic, collect the other three relics, upgrade them to gold and perform the four-item pedestal ritual. The sections below follow that order. Once the portal is permanently unlocked, skip to Repeat visits. Joining another squad’s portal does not establish your personal unlock.</li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-loadout" data-guide-step>Prepare upgraded rarity AND Pack-a-Punch, armour, useful perks, spare self-revives, ammunition and crowd-control tacticals. Make room for relics/plans before entry. Carry a mask for gas areas and coordinate revive/crowd-control roles. Prepare the next objective rather than relying on a fixed release-era best-gun recommendation.</li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-sigils" data-guide-step>Repeat ordinary entry uses a triangular Sigil and a 30-minute timer; Elder entry uses an Elder Sigil and a 15-minute timer. Find the corresponding interaction side, confirm its variant and accept the squad travel vote. Ordinary rewards are acquisitions/Elder Sigil opportunities; Elder visits provide schematic opportunities; check each Reward Rift for the actual loot. The 2024 temporary ordinary-entry waiver is historical; follow the current item prompt.</li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-inventory" data-guide-step>You can collect the relics over several deployments. Keep each item in your rucksack through a successful exfil, then bring it back when you are ready to upgrade or place it. Losing carried relics after your permanent portal ritual is complete does not remove the unlock.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-ascension">Ascension: weaken the Entity and finish its true ending</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-ascension-entry" data-guide-step>Use the named Ascension story portal in the gazebo at the northeast side of Opal Palace’s fountain square. Confirm its mission name and squad vote. If gold Mr. Peeks is already safely owned, first-unlock players can skip repeating this story.<p><a href="/guides/mw3-urzikstan#map:season-5-portal">Find the Opal Palace portal area on the Urzikstan map ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-03.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-03.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Ascension story portal entrance beside Opal Palace&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Ascension story portal entrance beside Opal Palace&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-03&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-first-obelisk" data-guide-step>At the F6 story obelisk, interact with four nearby relics to send them to Ava: Gloves northeast of the obelisk, Drum in the western floating train car, Target on its connected flatbed and Mirror to the south. Activate the obelisk and make zombie kills close to Ava until she destroys it.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-04.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-04.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Gloves location&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Gloves location&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-04&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-05.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-05.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Drum in the train&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Drum in the train&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-05&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-06.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-06.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Target on the connected platform&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Target on the connected platform&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-06&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-07.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-07.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Mirror location&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;First obelisk Mirror location&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-07&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-second-obelisk" data-guide-step>At E5’s next obelisk, send Journal from eastern rubble, Giraffe beside the stone tower, Drawing on the floating truck and Laptop on the road beneath it. Charge Ava with kills. When the Entity scatters these relics, follow their markers and send them back so charging can resume.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-08.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-08.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Journal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Journal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-08&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-09.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-09.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Giraffe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Giraffe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-09&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-10.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-10.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Drawing&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Drawing&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-10&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-11.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-11.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Laptop&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second obelisk Laptop&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-11&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-tower-climb" data-guide-step>Follow the objective to Ava/Ravenov at the tower. Ride a floating train to the raised island, then the orbiting boats/cars to the roof while avoiding window Manglers. Break the red crystal on the NORTH roof and use the opened launch pad/Aether Rift. Follow the connected platforms and pads to the arena; a Scorcher is optional movement support, not a quest prerequisite.</li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-entity-first" data-guide-step>Meet Ava/Ravenov at the altar and damage the Entity by shooting the glowing orbs on its body. Avoid its beam and shoot the tracking purple orbs released as it changes platforms. Repeat until the first health bar empties; the apparent first Reward Rift is a FAKE ending.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-12.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-12.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;The Entity’s visible body-orb damage targets&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;The Entity’s visible body-orb damage targets&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-12&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-entity-final" data-guide-step>In the real final phase, the Entity is initially invulnerable. Join Ava on the boss’s current platform and kill zombies nearby to charge her attack. Once she opens vulnerability, destroy the exposed body orbs. Use launch pads to escape the all-platform lightning; clearing the full orb set can interrupt it. Each relocation requires another Ava charge and vulnerable damage cycle.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-13.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-13.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Second-phase Entity arena and platform movement&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Second-phase Entity arena and platform movement&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-13&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-peeks-story" data-guide-step>After the true defeat, collect GOLD Mr. Peeks from the real Reward Rift. Let the dialogue finish, then use Ava’s opened exit to complete Ascension and keep the item. Neither the false first defeat nor three ordinary contracts supply this story relic.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-story-14.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-story-14.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Ascension’s concluding reward/exit scene&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Ascension’s concluding reward/exit scene&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-story-14&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-echo-relics">Obtain the three purple Echo relics</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-echo-diary" data-guide-step>Use an Aether Blade on grouped Special zombies until the Echo of Locked Diary reward appears. The G6 submerged triangle/Mimic activity provides a practical cluster: find its three water runes by audio, shoot them, align its triangle from the dock and work the spawned Mimics. Bounce the blade through grouped Specials rather than promising a fixed five-kill rule; collect the actual purple Echo Diary rift.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-04.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-04.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;G6 waterway rune example&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;G6 waterway rune example&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-04&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-05.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-05.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Submerged triangle alignment&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Submerged triangle alignment&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-05&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-06.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-06.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Aether Blade special-enemy action&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Aether Blade special-enemy action&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-06&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-07.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-07.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Echo of Locked Diary reward item&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Echo of Locked Diary reward item&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-07&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-echo-drum" data-guide-step>Find or summon a Blood Burner and reach the canal around F4/G4 beside its Peeks cue. Drive on the water following the WHITE arrows: down the canal, right into the river, onto land before the bridge, then along the road past the wrecked car. Collect the purple Echo of Drum from the course Reward Rift.<p><a href="/guides/mw3-urzikstan#map:s5-drum-course">Find the Blood Burner course start on the Urzikstan map ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-12.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-12.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Blood Burner canal-course map reference&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Blood Burner canal-course map reference&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-12&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-13.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-13.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Blood Burner course starting/arrow cue&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Blood Burner course starting/arrow cue&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-13&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-14.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-14.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Echo of Drum reward&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Echo of Drum reward&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-14&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-echo-giraffe" data-guide-step>Activate Sergeant’s Beret to disguise yourself. At a mercenary camp, approach the relevant guard from behind and hold the melee control for an EXECUTION, rather than an ordinary punch or firearm kill. Collect purple Echo of Giraffe Toy from its Reward Rift.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-19.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-19.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Disguised rear execution for Echo Giraffe&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Disguised rear execution for Echo Giraffe&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-19&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-20.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-20.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Echo of Giraffe Toy reward&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Echo of Giraffe Toy reward&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-20&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-attunement">Attune each Echo through its meteor event</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-diary-gold" data-guide-step>Carry Echo Diary to the D2 eagle-ramp statue and interact with its corpse/meteor. Take/activate the supplied PhD Flopper if needed. Use the golden portal to the Popov power chimney, then dolphin-dive onto the BLUE container’s Phoenix marking below. A missed landing can be retried through the portal beneath the tower. Claim GOLD Echo Diary from the successful landing rift.<p><a href="/guides/mw3-urzikstan#map:s5-diary-upgrade">Find the eagle-ramp meteor on the Urzikstan map ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-09.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-09.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Eagle corpse/meteor attunement interaction&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Eagle corpse/meteor attunement interaction&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-09&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-10.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-10.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Phoenix-marked blue container landing target&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Phoenix-marked blue container landing target&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-10&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-11.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-11.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gold Echo Diary reward&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gold Echo Diary reward&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-11&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-drum-gold" data-guide-step>Carry Echo Drum to the four-pillar square east of F7 Shorok Opera House. Use a vehicle to reach the central corpse/meteor pillar and begin its ritual. Interact with the surrounding pillars to take the requested mods, then kill each coloured zombie with its MATCHING element: green Brain Rot, blue Dead Wire, white Cryo Freeze and red Napalm Burst. Collect GOLD Echo Drum when all required kills register.<p><a href="/guides/mw3-urzikstan#map:s5-drum-upgrade">Find the four-pillar square area on the Urzikstan map ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-16.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-16.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Opera House central meteor interaction&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Opera House central meteor interaction&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-16&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-17.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-17.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Coloured elemental-zombie ritual&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Coloured elemental-zombie ritual&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-17&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-18.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-18.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gold Echo Drum reward&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gold Echo Drum reward&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-18&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-giraffe-gold" data-guide-step>At the square east of F4 Nahr Bathhouse, crouch into the wrecked van to use its corpse/meteor with Echo Giraffe carried. Defeat the chain: Mega Abomination, EMP Mimic, then Disciple. Kill the Disciple’s marked minions whenever they protect it, and finish the main target for GOLD Echo Giraffe.<p><a href="/guides/mw3-urzikstan#map:s5-giraffe-upgrade">Find the wrecked-van area on the Urzikstan map ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-22.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-22.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Nahr wrecked-van meteor interaction&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Nahr wrecked-van meteor interaction&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-22&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-23.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-23.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Echo Giraffe elite chain&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Echo Giraffe elite chain&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-23&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-24.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-24.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Gold Echo Giraffe reward&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Gold Echo Giraffe reward&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-24&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-portal">Complete the Opal Palace gold-relic ritual</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-gold-pedestals" data-guide-step>Bring GOLD Mr. Peeks and all three GOLD Echo relics to the F5 Opal Palace fountain inside its tornado. Match each pedestal engraving. Earlier seasons’ ordinary Diary, Drum and Giraffe are not their Echo versions and do not substitute.<p><a href="/guides/mw3-urzikstan#map:season-5-portal">Find the Season 5 fountain area on the Urzikstan map ↗</a></p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-26.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-26.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Opal Palace fountain pedestal interaction&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Opal Palace fountain pedestal interaction&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-26&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-gate-mega" data-guide-step>Defeat the spawned Mega Abomination and collect its access/Sigil reward. Confirm personal permanent access, then prepare the correct ordinary/Elder interaction for future trips. No repeated relic ritual is required after the unlock is complete.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-contracts">Navigate three floating contract starters</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-movement" data-guide-step>Use the map’s launch pads and Aether Tears to move between rooftops/floating structures. Follow each gold beam/Peeks cue and identify a reachable exit first. You can move without a Scorcher; recover a missed jump through the available lower route/pad rather than abandoning a carried key or contract.</li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-outlast" data-guide-step>Reach the north/lower Highrise roof at G2 and take its Outlast Peeks on the box. Go to the marked ground-floor PND and remain inside its analysis room until complete. Keep your return route to the roof and exit in mind.<ShowOnMap target="mw5-outlast" /><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-28.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-28.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;North Highrise Outlast Peeks starter&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;North Highrise Outlast Peeks starter&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-28&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-29.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-29.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Highrise ground-floor Outlast objective&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Highrise ground-floor Outlast objective&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-29&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-spore-contract" data-guide-step>Reach the floating D3 crane’s Spore Control Peeks. Collect the inhibitors and use them at each marked spore before shooting it. Some objectives sit on floating islands; check a safe pad/Tear approach and retrieve needed inhibitors deliberately. These contract spores are separate from the hidden R4D spore below Highrise.<ShowOnMap target="mw5-spore-contract" /><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-31.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-31.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Floating-crane Spore Control Peeks&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Floating-crane Spore Control Peeks&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-31&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-32.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-32.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Floating Spore Control objective reference&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Floating Spore Control objective reference&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-32&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-escort" data-guide-step>Reach the E5 broken billboard Peeks for Escort and follow the ACV’s long route. Protect all four stops, using crowd-control equipment and optional packed V-R11 repair. The final stop can benefit from an available turret circuit; no turret spawn is guaranteed. A destroyed ACV fails this contract.<ShowOnMap target="mw5-escort" /><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-34.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-34.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Billboard Escort Peeks starter&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Billboard Escort Peeks starter&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-34&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/mw-s5-unlock-35.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/mw-s5-unlock-35.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Season 5 ACV Escort objective&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Season 5 ACV Escort objective&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;Gameranx / Matt Villei; Call of Duty gameplay imagery&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800,&quot;height&quot;:450,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://gameranx.com/features/id/506654/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-get-all-4-relics-and-enter-the-final-dark-aether-rift/&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;mw-s5-unlock-35&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-contract-rewards" data-guide-step>Ordinary contract rewards can provide Disciple Bottle or Grenade Bandolier acquisitions and possible Elder Sigils. Elder is the schematic route for those two items and Stash Increase, with possible duplicate rewards. Stash Increase is an account/storage benefit, not an equipment bottle consumed during combat. Carry plans to extraction and confirm the actual unlock.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-infinite-cosmos">Optional Elder-only Infinite Cosmos blueprint</h2><p class="guide-callout">Optional separate quest: the blueprint requires Elder. Preserve the carried Skull/Drive/Key and reserve enough time for the squad portal and boss.</p><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-cosmos-spore" data-guide-step>For the Infinite Cosmos STG44 blueprint, enter with an ELDER Sigil. Under the main Highrise building, place an inhibitor by the unmarked central-room spore and shoot it after its shell opens. Take the dropped R4D detector; this spore is separate from the ordinary contract objectives.<ShowOnMap target="cosmos-maze" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-cosmos-skull" data-guide-step>Use R4D to reveal/follow the room’s arrows through the maze in sequence. At the yellow glow stick, look through the detector to reveal and stow the Damp Gold Skull. Have a teammate cover the reader; a missed jump does not remove the clue sequence.<ShowOnMap target="cosmos-maze" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-cosmos-trade" data-guide-step>Return to the Golden Whale lobby across from the R4D building. Reach the whale’s head and trade the skull for the IT Thumb Drive. Its serial clue points to C3’s Spec Electronics; confirm the drive is carried before leaving.<ShowOnMap target="cosmos-maze" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-cosmos-key" data-guide-step>At Spec Electronics in C3, use the second-floor error-screen computer with the drive. Defeat the marked Keyholder Mangler and collect the Maintenance Tower Key from its drop. A normal Mangler kill without this interaction is not the key step.<ShowOnMap target="cosmos-computer" /></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-cosmos-door" data-guide-step>Return to the Highrise roof/exfil level by the floating-train route or available movement equipment. Unlock the maintenance door with the key. Bring EVERY squad member inside: the portal changes from red to purple when the squad is present. Finish other desired activities before entering.<ShowOnMap target="cosmos-maintenance" /><p class="guide-callout">Squad commitment: entering this portal starts Entity’s Echo. Three completed contracts alone do not trigger this blueprint route.</p></li>
<li id="guide-step-mw5-cosmos-echo" data-guide-step>Fight Entity’s Echo by damaging its visible body orbs, moving between pads to avoid beams and clearing tracking orbs/adds. Assign crowd control and boss damage as needed. Confirm the Infinite Cosmos STG44 unlock after the Elder defeat and use the ending/exit cue. An ordinary version of this secret fight does not award the blueprint.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-exfil">Use the story or contract exit</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-mw5-exfil" data-guide-step>Ascension leaves through Ava’s portal after the true Entity ending. Repeat visits have photographed Highrise/roof and lower E7 exit options; use the actual available red portal before the run expires. Keep acquired relics/plans in your rucksack and verify the post-match rewards. Infinite Cosmos has its own boss ending/exit commitment.<ShowOnMap target="exits" /><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/wzhub-season-5-m3223-1.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/wzhub-season-5-m3223-1.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Highrise/upper exit reference&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Highrise/upper exit reference&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;WZHUB; individual screenshot creator not identified&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1080,&quot;height&quot;:635,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://wzhub.gg/map/dark-aether-s5r/mwz?p=m3223&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;wzhub-season-5-m3223-1&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/wzhub-season-5-m3223-2.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/wzhub-season-5-m3223-2.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Upper exit approach&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Upper exit approach&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;WZHUB; individual screenshot creator not identified&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1080,&quot;height&quot;:654,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://wzhub.gg/map/dark-aether-s5r/mwz?p=m3223&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;wzhub-season-5-m3223-2&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/wzhub-season-5-m3241-1.jpg&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/wzhub-season-5-m3241-1.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lower E7 exit reference&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lower E7 exit reference&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;WZHUB; individual screenshot creator not identified&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1080,&quot;height&quot;:965,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://wzhub.gg/map/dark-aether-s5r/mwz?p=m3241&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;wzhub-season-5-m3241-1&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Illustrated instructions from the references below, source-reviewed on 8 October 2026 and reorganized on 9 October 2026. The guide links, saved-progress compatibility and page behavior have software checks. These walkthroughs have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Gameplay-image and chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://gameranx.com/features/id/506621/article/modern-warfare-zombies-how-to-complete-the-final-story-mission-ascension-story-mission-walkthrough/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">gameranx.com reference ↗</a></li>
